Grailed is a curated, community-driven marketplace for 30M+ pre-owned luxury and streetwear items from 10,000 designers. The platform employs dual-layer authentication: AI flags listings inconsistent with known authentic items, while human experts examine high-risk goods. Trusted sellers provide ID and payment verification; community members immediately flag counterfeits. Grailed Protection guarantees refunds for non-arrival, inauthenticity, or significant misrepresentation. By combining algorithmic detection, expert curation, and community validation, Grailed builds trust in secondhand transactions at scale, enabling peer-to-peer value capture while extending product lifecycles. The platform demonstrates how social proof and transparent authentication can accelerate acceptance of pre-owned luxury goods.